# T1.1 Stage S1: addr-keyed `_dynarray_len` array exposes a k-induction
# completeness gap.  The inductive step havocs the entire length array
# instead of just the current `this->$address` slot, so it cannot carry
# `len[$this_addr] == 0` across iterations.  Property still holds under
# BMC.  Proper fix is array-element-aware modified-loop-vars analysis,
